    "custom_liquid_testimonials_static": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .rt-testimonials {\n    padding: 48px 20px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .rt-testimonials h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Alfa Slab One\", serif;\n    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 36px);\n    margin: 0 0 32px;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .rt-testimonials-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n    gap: 20px;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .rt-testimonial-card {\n    background: #f9f9f9;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 24px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .rt-stars { color: #f5a623; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n  .rt-testimonial-text { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; flex: 1; }\n  .rt-testimonial-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #000; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"rt-testimonials\">\n  <h2>What Our Customers Say</h2>\n  <div class=\"rt-testimonials-grid\">\n    <div class=\"rt-testimonial-card\">\n      <div class=\"rt-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n      <p class=\"rt-testimonial-text\">These socks are awesome! I am a distance runner that often runs before or after daylight, and these have proved very useful. They fit perfectly, have great compression technology and breathable fabric, and are VERY reflective. I would 100% recommend these to runners, bikers, hikers, etc.</p>\n      <span class=\"rt-testimonial-name\">Thomas M.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rt-testimonial-card\">\n      <div class=\"rt-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</div>\n      <p class=\"rt-testimonial-text\">Great gloves. I got them in the color pink and size small, and they were great. Not only did they keep my hands warm but the reflective part is nice and big and makes me more visible on early morning or late evening runs.</p>\n      <span class=\"rt-testimonial-name\">Amanda L.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rt-testimonial-card\">\n      <div class=\"rt-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n      <p class=\"rt-testimonial-text\">It is hard to find a jersey that is both bright during the day and bright at night. Most neon jerseys don't have reflectors and are therefore invisible at night. This has both and will keep you bright all the time! Definitely would recommend.</p>\n      <span class=\"rt-testimonial-name\">Amazon C.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rt-testimonial-card\">\n      <div class=\"rt-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n      <p class=\"rt-testimonial-text\">Amazing socks! They make me super visible at night, safety first!</p>\n      <span class=\"rt-testimonial-name\">Robert</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "background_color": "{{ settings.color_palette.background }}",
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
